    "northern_disturbance": {
      "title": "The Northern Disturbance",
      "text": "Before sunrise the ground shook near the old northern ruins, and the night watch saw light beneath the stones. The wall by the square cracked from below, and the surveyor's compass will not settle. Bram closed the northern path after a rockfall. When I held the compass up I saw it myself: a light under the ridge, there and gone. Elder Rowan has put me in charge of the field survey. Elara will scout and Orin will see to our equipment. No heroics, he said."
    }
  }
}